LiftOff is a Bedrock adaptation of Carry On by Tschipp
(https://github.com/Tschipp/CarryOn), version 2.11.2. Carry On is
Copyright (C) 2024 Tschipp and is licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public
License, version 3 or (at your option) any later version, per its source
headers. Portions of LiftOff's text and behaviour logic are derived from Carry
On and are used under LGPL-3.0.

Changes from Carry On:
- Reimplemented in C++ as a LeviLamina native mod for Minecraft Bedrock Edition
  (dedicated server and client), in place of the Java Forge/Fabric/NeoForge mod.
- Behaviour adapted to Bedrock blocks, entities, input, rendering and storage;
  configuration, commands and in-game text reworked for Bedrock.
- LiftOff ships no textures, models or sounds from Carry On. Its resource pack
  contains only player arm-pose animations written for Bedrock and language
  files.

